    "description": {
      "value": "You shake the earth, toppling nearby creatures. Choose whether the spell's area is a 15-foot emanation or a 15-foot cone when you cast it. Each creature in the area standing on solid ground may take 4d6 bludgeoning damage and must attempt a Reflex saving throw.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and falls prone.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and falls prone."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): Increase the damage by 2d6."
